  "notes": "Values are stored as the printed scoring values (item 1 is 0–6, items 2–16 are 0–5), so no reverse scoring is applied in code; items marked printed_descending are printed with 5 on the left, and bipolar items carry their two poles. Total 0–81 (6 + 15 × 5), cutoff 51.5 per Funk & Rogge 2007. Item set and printed values verified from source_url.",
